# Files that must never reach the deployment.
#
# The CLI uploads the working tree, so anything gitignored is still uploaded
# unless it is listed here as well. These are the project's private keys and
# the account session: the agent's runtime key, the seller's key, the Passport
# login and the SERV API key.
.env
.env.local
.env.*
!.env.example
.kite-passport/
.secrets/
*.key
audit.md
capsule-blueprint.md
packages/
*:Zone.Identifier
